 "name_en": "Preference Management with SAP Global Trade Services (3JX)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Preference Management with SAP Global Trade Services (3JX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item integrates SAP Global Trade Services Preference Management with <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span>. Customers can use their existing SAP Global Trade Services installations to manage long-term vendor declarations and the preference determination for static bills of materials.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Transfer customers, suppliers, and products from <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> to SAP Global Trade Services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage long-term vendor declarations</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage preference determination for static bills of materials</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Use existing installations of SAP Global Trade Services for handling all global trade scenarios (enhancement with preference management)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Leverage an existing investment in SAP Global Trade Services Preference Management for a best-of-breed deployment of an international trade solution</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>通过 SAP Global Trade Services 的优惠管理 (3JX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目将 SAP Global Trade Services 优惠管理与 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 集成。客户可以使用其现有 SAP Global Trade Services 安装来管理长期供应商声明和静态物料清单的优惠确定。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">将客户、供应商和产品从 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Private Edition</span> 传输到 SAP Global Trade Services</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理长期供应商申报</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理静态物料清单的优惠确定</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiod8787b0decea44d68cf5114bedc99fc9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 SAP Global Trade Services 的现有安装处理所有全球贸易场景（通过优惠管理增强）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">利用 SAP Global Trade Services 优惠管理中的现有投资，以最佳方式部署国际贸易解决方案</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
